<title>USA: Russell says to unveil index changes June 13.</title>
<headline>Russell says to unveil index changes June 13.</headline>
<dateline>TACOMA, Wash. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frank Russell Co said it would announce probable changes in its various U.S. stock indices on June 13.</p>
<p>The largest 1,000 companies by market capitalization are included in the Russell 1000 Index, while the next 2,000 corporations comprise the small-cap Russell 2000.</p>
<p>The final index lists will be disclosed during the week of July 7.</p>
